  "boot.tip.1": "Metin stones fall from the sky every minute or so. Break them before they awaken.",
  "boot.tip.2": "An awakened Metin summons elites and raises the corruption meter, but pays out far better rewards.",
  "boot.tip.3": "Skills reach their final rank P at rank 8 — and awaken with a special extra effect.",
  "boot.tip.4": "The Blacksmith never destroys your gear. A failed refine only costs materials.",
  "boot.tip.5": "Rarity decides how strong a card is. Luck raises your odds of rare cards.",
  "boot.tip.6": "Bosses carry gear for your class. Beat them again and again — duplicates become Metin shards.",
  "boot.tip.7": "Talent respec is always free. Try both doctrines!",
  "boot.tip.8": "Banish removes a card from your pool for the rest of the run.",
  "boot.tip.9": "Soul pearls can be socketed up to +4. Replace weak ones when a better pearl drops.",
  "boot.tip.10": "Each empire grants a permanent bonus. Saehwa: health. Chowon: experience. Jihae: Yeop and luck.",
